/// One row per remittance, 69,111 of them - exactly one per paid claim. There are no partial payments, no takebacks and no secondary payer, so days-to-pay is a single clean event. PaymentAmount is the SAME money as FactClaim[PaidAmount] seen on the cash date instead of the service date; the two are never added together.
